{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.6839599609375,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review was conducted, focusing on economic evaluations of moderate complexity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96288776397705,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.1957397460938,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "automated NAATs. Four online databases (Embase, Medline, Web of Science and Scopus)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9700317382812,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "were searched for new studies published from 1 January 2010 through 17 September 2020.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.6180419921875,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "The citations of all eligible articles, guidelines and reviews were reviewed for additional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.903076171875,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "studies. Experts and test manufacturers were also contacted to identify any additional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        172.1313018798828,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "unpublished studies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        526.7540283203125,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "The objective of the review was to summarize current economic evidence and further understand",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        507.2949523925781,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "the costs, cost–effectiveness and affordability of moderate complexity automated NAATs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.16912841796875,
        526.5839233398438,
        223.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "Several commercially available tests were included as eligible tests in the moderate complexity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987743377685547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.66912841796875,
        526.960205078125,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "automated NAATs category; however, no published studies were identified assessing the costs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980382919311523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.16912841796875,
        526.9634399414062,
        254.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "or cost–effectiveness of any of those tests. One unpublished study comparing available data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.66912841796875,
        526.964599609375,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "on two technologies from moderate complexity automated NAATs class was identified, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        295.0762023925781,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "the data from that study are described below.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        296.17303466796875,
        526.9370727539062,
        309.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "Unpublished data from FIND was provided through direct communication. This costing-only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        311.67303466796875,
        527.185546875,
        324.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "study used time and motion studies combined with a bottom-up, ingredients-based approach",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990145683288574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        327.1535949707031,
        526.90380859375,
        340.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "9 to estimate the unit test cost for the two selected technologies.  Time and motion studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.6730041503906,
        526.9645385742188,
        355.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "were conducted at a reference-level laboratory in South Africa. Several important simplifying",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1730041503906,
        526.9259643554688,
        371.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "assumptions were made that may limit the generalizability of the results; for example, 50%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.6730041503906,
        526.9482421875,
        386.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "of laboratory operations dedicated to TB, a minimum daily throughput of 24 samples or the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.1730041503906,
        526.9591064453125,
        402.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "equivalent of one BD MAX run (24 tests/run), equipment costs fixed at US$ 100 000 for both",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.6730041503906,
        526.9698486328125,
        417.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "platforms, a 5% annual maintenance cost, and the standard 3% discount rate and 10 years",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.1730041503906,
        196.6269989013672,
        433.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "expected useful life years.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.1769104003906,
        526.9866333007812,
        457.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "Additional literature searches conducted to look for economic data using similar platforms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.6769104003906,
        526.9644165039062,
        472.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "from non-TB disease areas identified three additional studies from HIV and hepatitis C virus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.1769104003906,
        526.9307861328125,
        488.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "(HCV) with limited cost data: one ( ) using Abbott RealTi e HIV and two on HCV (6,7). Data  5 m",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.6769104003906,
        527.2338256835938,
        503.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "were limited to cost per unit test kit and are not transferrable to test kit costs for the tests being",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974370002746582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.1768798828125,
        194.6916046142578,
        519.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "considered in this review.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.367919921875,
        306.6951599121094,
        543.2489013671875
      ],
      "text": "How large are the resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.184814453125,
        526.9164428710938,
        567.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "Available unit test costs for two moderate complexity automated NAATs ranged from US$ 18.52",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.684814453125,
        526.8297119140625,
        582.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "(US$ 13.79–40.70) and US$ 15.37 (US$ 9.61–37.40), with one study reporting cheaper per-test",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986241340637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.184814453125,
        526.9920654296875,
        598.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "kit costs and higher operational costs associated with laboratory processing time. Equipment",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.684814453125,
        526.828369140625,
        613.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "costs were strong drivers of cost variation and will vary across laboratory networks and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.184814453125,
        526.7267456054688,
        629.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "operations. If equipment can be optimally placed or multiplexed to ensure high testing volume,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.962486267089844,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.684814453125,
        242.43077087402344,
        644.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "the per-test cost can be minimized.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.6888427734375,
        526.57958984375,
        668.8338623046875
      ],
      "text": "In one-way sensitivity analyses, annual testing volumes varied from fewer than 5000 tests/year",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979731559753418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.1888427734375,
        527.0053100585938,
        684.3338623046875
      ],
      "text": "to more than 25 000 tests/year. Per-test cost was highly sensitive to testing volume when fewer",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.6888427734375,
        527.0250854492188,
        699.8338623046875
      ],
      "text": "than 5000 tests were conducted per year; however, unit test costs begin to stabilize between",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.1888427734375,
        527.2112426757812,
        715.3338623046875
      ],
      "text": "5000 and 10 000 tests/year, and above 10 000 tests/year, unit cost estimate was robust. When",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982135772705078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.6888427734375,
        481.95166015625,
        730.8338623046875
      ],
      "text": "equipment can be multiplexed and used at capacity, per-test cost can be minimized.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        763.3696899414062,
        304.49810791015625,
        772.9437866210938
      ],
      "text": "9\t Data courtesy of H Sohn and W Stevens at FIND (unpublished).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "30 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}